AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Rajendra Singh, S/o Thakur Singh, aged 38 years,
residing at 12, Civil Lines, Jodhpur – 342 001,
Site Engineer, M/s. Roadcon Infra Pvt. Ltd.,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am the Site Engineer for the NH-148B Extension Project and am fully conversant
   with the facts stated herein.

2. I was present at the site continuously from 15.09.2020 onwards and have personal
   knowledge of all site activities and NHAI's actions/inactions.

3. Regarding the forest clearance delay: I personally supervised the preparation
   of the forest clearance application in October 2020. All required documents
   (tree count, wildlife survey, environmental impact assessment) were submitted
   to NHAI on 15.10.2020.

4. NHAI forwarded the application to the Forest Department on 01.11.2020.
   However, the Forest Department only issued the clearance on 10.02.2022 —
   a delay of 240 days.

5. During this 240-day period, the following resources remained idle:
   - Bridge construction equipment for 2 major bridges (Km 32+500 and Km 36+200)
   - 75 specialized workers (bridge fabrication team)
   - Cranes and concrete pumps
   - Daily idle cost: ₹2.85 Lakh × 240 days = ₹6.84 Crore (claim proportionally reduced)

6. Regarding the revised alignment (VO-001): On 01.04.2021, the NHAI Project Director
   verbally instructed us to shift the alignment by 200-500 meters in certain
   sections to avoid ecological zones. This added 3.2 km of additional work.

7. I have recorded this instruction in my site diary dated 01.04.2021.
   The revised alignment drawings were received from NHAI on 15.05.2021.

8. We executed the additional 3.2 km work as per the revised alignment.
   However, NHAI has not formally priced this in a Variation Order.

9. Regarding steel price escalation: Steel prices increased from ₹48,000/ton
   (base date September 2020) to ₹80,600/ton (September 2021) — a 68% increase.
   This affected bridge construction significantly as bridges require substantial steel.

10. All facts stated above are within my personal knowledge and are true to the best of my
    information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Rajendra Singh
Date: 01.12.2022
Place: Jodhpur

Sworn before me:
Oath Commissioner / Notary Public